identifiableProperties.hbm) declaring both not-null=\"true\".\nEvery application code path already sets these via setAutoFields()\nbefore persisting, so the DB constraint was purely a latent gap -\nexploited only by out-of-band writes that bypass Hibernate, leaving\nrows that crash the Maps app when rendering an invalid date.\n\nBackfill any existing nulls to now(), then enforce NOT NULL and add\nDEFAULT now() as a DB-level safety net, mirroring setAutoFields()\nsemantics (same pattern as V2_43_6__data_value_defaults.sql).","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"281b1f485acd38a565b81fb8d28225970aad0a31","tree_id":"83ee63f159941ca3ff6cc1c02b0e84ddda10fd51","timestamp":"2026-07-30T12:19:25Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":